x56x0          |-(ys*pow(2,-0.5))                                                                                              % H    s~   s     coupling.
x57x0          |-(yb*pow(2,-0.5))                                                                                              % H    b~   b     coupling.
x58x0          |ye/2.                                                                                                          % W-.f e+   ve    coupling.
